# Milestone 24 — Attendance Reports

- **Status:** Not started
- **Objective:** Add reports, filters, CSV export, and two-year retention checks so staff can review and export attendance history.
- **Dependencies:** 21 (Student time out)

## Included work
- Reports: daily report, date-range report, student history, class history, current attendance, missing checkout report, override report, SMS-failure report.
- Report columns: Student ID, student name, class, date, time in, drop-off ack status/time, pickup ack status/time, time out, total duration, override status, override reason.
- Duration = `student_time_out − student_time_in` (never pickup ack time).
- Filters: student, class, date range, missing drop-off ack, missing pickup ack, missing time out, drop-off overrides, pickup overrides, currently checked-in, completed sessions.
- CSV export and daily CSV export.
- SQLite backup export entry point (actual backup logic deferred to M31).
- Two-year retention check (warn if older records would be purged; no automatic purge in this milestone).
- Desktop admin reports screen with filter UI and export buttons.
- PIN protection for exports.
- Unit and integration tests.

## Explicitly excluded work
- No automatic data purging (retention check only).
- No PDF reports (CSV only here).
- No backup/restore logic (deferred to M31).

