## Acceptance criteria
- All report types produce correct results.
- Duration is calculated as time out minus time in.
- Filters work for all documented criteria.
- CSV export produces valid CSV with masked phones.
- Two-year retention check warns about old records.
- Exports require PIN.
- `npm run typecheck` and `npm run test` pass.

## Required automated tests
- Two-year attendance report.
- Daily report.
- Missing checkout report.
- Override report.
- SMS-failure report.
- CSV export correctness.
- Filter combinations.
- Duration calculation (never uses pickup ack time).

## Manual verification steps
1. Generate attendance data spanning multiple days.
2. Open the reports screen, apply filters, and export a daily CSV.
3. Confirm the CSV opens in a spreadsheet and phones are masked.

